; In a transaction that exchanges two commodities, without stating a cost
; or leaving a posting blank, Ledger normally prices the commodity of the
; first real posting in the other.  Balanced virtual postings belong to
; a separate group and cannot choose the real group's reference posting.
; When that reference holds neither commodity, Ledger prices the
; commodity that entered the group's balance first.
; Ledger adds up the real postings in order, and at the first posting in
; a second commodity the sum of the postings before it enters the balance
; first, unless it is zero: a zero sum never enters, and the first to
; enter is then the commodity of the first non-zero posting from there on.
; Either way, when only one of the two is already a price target, that one
; is the price (#1130).
;
; The first transaction moves 50 EUR from the bank to the wallet before
; buying 100 GBP for 115 EUR.  The move sums to zero, so GBP enters first,
; but EUR is still the real reference posting's commodity and remains in
; the final balance: EUR is priced in GBP, and the EUR postings become
; lots.  The second is the first without its budget lines, in SEK and CHF:
; it likewise prices SEK, the commodity of its first posting.  The third
; is the first in DKK and NOK, with a 10 DKK fee paid before buying NOK,
; so the sum is 10 DKK:
; DKK is priced in NOK, and the DKK postings become lots.  Each
; transaction exchanges its own pair of currencies, so that none is a
; price target yet.  SEK sorts after the other currency and EUR and DKK
; before it, so no fixed order of the two components can pass for the rule
; in all three transactions, and neither can the order in which a balance
; keeps them, which changes from run to run.
;
; xact-price-inference-zero-sums.test and 3314_inference_order.test cover
; the fallback when the reference commodity is absent from the balance.

2024/01/05 Exchange after a transfer
    [Budget:Travel]          $100
    [Budget:Available]      $-100
    Assets:Wallet:EUR        50 EUR
    Assets:Bank:EUR         -50 EUR
    Assets:GBP              100 GBP
    Assets:Bank:EUR        -115 EUR

2024/01/06 Exchange after a transfer, without budget lines
    Assets:Wallet:SEK        50 SEK
    Assets:Bank:SEK         -50 SEK
    Assets:CHF              100 CHF
    Assets:Bank:SEK        -115 SEK

2024/01/07 Exchange after a transfer and a fee
    [Budget:Travel]          $100
    [Budget:Available]      $-100
    Assets:Wallet:DKK        50 DKK
    Assets:Bank:DKK         -50 DKK
    Expenses:Fees             10 DKK
    Assets:NOK              100 NOK
    Assets:Bank:DKK        -125 DKK

test pricedb
P 2024/01/05 00:00:00 EUR 0.869565 GBP
P 2024/01/06 00:00:00 SEK 0.869565 CHF
P 2024/01/07 00:00:00 DKK 0.869565 NOK
end test

test bal --lots --flat --no-total Assets
-175 DKK {0.869565 NOK} [2024/01/07]  Assets:Bank:DKK
-165 EUR {0.869565 GBP} [2024/01/05]  Assets:Bank:EUR
-165 SEK {0.869565 CHF} [2024/01/06]  Assets:Bank:SEK
             100 CHF  Assets:CHF
             100 GBP  Assets:GBP
             100 NOK  Assets:NOK
50 DKK {0.869565 NOK} [2024/01/07]  Assets:Wallet:DKK
50 EUR {0.869565 GBP} [2024/01/05]  Assets:Wallet:EUR
50 SEK {0.869565 CHF} [2024/01/06]  Assets:Wallet:SEK
end test
